**COMPONENT HIERARCHY**

```
Dashboard
├── DashboardHeader
│   ├── PageTitle
│   └── DateRangePicker
├── FilterBar
│   ├── SearchInput
│   ├── SelectFilter (status)
│   ├── SelectFilter (category)
│   └── ResetButton
├── StatsGrid
│   ├── StatCard (revenue)
│   ├── StatCard (users)
│   ├── StatCard (orders)
│   └── StatCard (conversion)
├── ChartSection
│   ├── LineChart (trends)
│   └── PieChart (distribution)
└── DataTable
    ├── TableHeader
    ├── TableRow (repeat)
    └── Pagination
```

**PROP DEFINITIONS**

*StatCard*
```typescript
interface StatCardProps {
  title: string;
  value: string | number;
  change?: number; // percentage change
  trend?: 'up' | 'down' | 'neutral';
  icon?: ReactNode;
  loading?: boolean;
}
```

*DataTable*
```typescript
interface Column<T> {
  key: keyof T;
  header: string;
  render?: (value: T[keyof T], row: T) => ReactNode;
  sortable?: boolean;
  width?: string;
}

interface DataTableProps<T> {
  data: T[];
  columns: Column<T>[];
  loading?: boolean;
  onSort?: (key: keyof T) => void;
  onPageChange?: (page: number) => void;
}
```

**COMPOSITION PATTERN**

```tsx
// Using compound components for flexibility
<Dashboard>
  <Dashboard.Header>
    <Dashboard.Title>Analytics</Dashboard.Title>
    <DateRangePicker />
  </Dashboard.Header>
  <Dashboard.Stats>
    <StatCard title="Revenue" value="$50K" change={12} trend="up" />
  </Dashboard.Stats>
  <Dashboard.Chart>
    <RevenueChart />
  </Dashboard.Chart>
</Dashboard>
```
